        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Pathogenic KCNQ2 variant plus early-onset seizures and developmental impairment",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires molecular confirmation; clinical features and EEG support diagnosis."
